          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP722 Millcreek Ravine South&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After participating in the CITO at nearby Jackie Fisher Park, we decided to grab a couple brass caps in the area. We were only able to find this cap however. This one turned out to be kind of a park and grab, as we were able to find the cap almost as soon as we got to GZ. This makes find #1708 for us. Thanks for maintaing this cache!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
